#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:27
msgid "Retain frame and response boundaries"
msgstr "保留 frame 与 response 边界"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:29
msgid ""
"COBS supplies message boundaries, without integrity or authentication. Its "
"incremental decoder discards overflow until a delimiter. Once ready, its "
"frame view borrows the decoder buffer until release; feed returns BUSY "
"without consuming a byte. Preserve that byte or stop reading upstream. If "
"integrity is required, validate the product-selected CRC before dispatching "
"the payload."
msgstr ""
"COBS 提供消息边界，不提供完整性或认证。增量 decoder 在 overflow 后丢弃输入直到 delimiter。ready 后，frame "
"view 借用 decoder buffer 直到 release；feed 返回 BUSY "
"且不消费字节。须保留该字节或暂停上游读取。需要完整性时，先验证产品选定的 CRC，再分发 payload。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:35
msgid ""
"ATClient copies an admitted command into caller TX storage, then service "
"advances partial stream writes and reads under the original absolute "
"deadline and explicit call budget. Response, URC and binary callback views "
"expire when the callback returns. Binary lengths come from reviewed module-"
"specific responses; there is no assumed module or prompt grammar. A timeout,"
" malformed line or stream failure can desynchronize the session after real "
"command effects. Recover software parsing only after the product "
"reestablishes the actual module boundary and joins transport users; never "
"blindly replay the command."
msgstr ""
"ATClient 将已准入 command 复制到调用者 TX 存储，再由 service 按原绝对 deadline 和显式调用预算推进 "
"partial stream write／read。Response、URC 和 binary callback view 在 callback "
"返回后失效。binary 长度来自已审模块特定 response，不假定模块或 prompt 语法。timeout、畸形行或 stream 失败可能在 "
"command 已产生实际效果后使会话失同步。只有产品重新建立模块真实边界并 join transport 使用者后，才恢复软件解析；不得盲目 "
"replay command。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:44
msgid ""
"Selected binary framing is decided before the next byte is consumed, "
"including when the header and binary body share one transport read. The "
"exact [ESP-AT device](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/devices/esp_at/README.md) supplies its "
"reviewed grammar; the generic parser does not guess a modem personality."
msgstr ""
"选定的二进制分帧在消费下一个字节前就确定边界，header 和 binary body 位于同一次传输读取时也如此。精确的 [ESP-AT "
"器件](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/devices/esp_at/README.md)提供已审核语法；通用 parser 不猜测 modem 类型。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:49
msgid "Copy UART bytes without replacing its owner"
msgstr "复制 UART 字节，保留既有所有者"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:51
msgid ""
"`Nexus::UARTByteStream` returns an existing `nx_byte_stream_t` over the "
"selected UART. A successful write copies a bounded prefix into caller-"
"provided staging and admits one inner request; it proves neither wire "
"completion nor peer delivery. No new write reuses staging before acquire-"
"observed SETTLED. RX loss or a short/failed TX closes admission. EMPTY UART "
"RX means BUSY, never EOF."
msgstr ""
"`Nexus::UARTByteStream` 在选定 UART 上返回既有 `nx_byte_stream_t`。write "
"成功表示把有界前缀复制到调用者暂存区，并接纳一个内部请求，不证明线上完成或对端交付。在 acquire 观察到 SETTLED 前，新 write "
"不复用暂存区。RX 丢失或 TX 短传输／失败会关闭准入。UART RX 的 EMPTY 表示 BUSY，始终不表示 EOF。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:57
msgid ""
"The task explicitly advances UART-stream service and then the consuming AT "
"module. ESP-AT configure, join, connect, send and close preserve each "
"original finite deadline. `SEND OK` is module-stack admission. Remote CLOSED"
" permits draining copied RX to EOF but is terminal for that session: actual "
"module/UART reset and synchronization, joined users and explicit recovery "
"precede another configure. Stop continues cancel/service even after a "
"latched fault and retains the accepted UART request until SETTLED; it does "
"not stop the outer UART/RX owner."
msgstr ""
"task 显式推进 UART-stream service，再推进消费它的 AT 模块。ESP-AT 的 "
"configure、join、connect、send 和 close 保持各自原始有限 deadline。`SEND OK` 表示模块协议栈接纳。远端"
" CLOSED 后可以先排空已复制 RX，再返回 EOF，但该会话已经终止；再次 configure 前，须实际 reset／同步模块与 "
"UART、会合使用者并显式恢复。即使故障已锁存，stop 仍继续 cancel／service，并保留已接受的 UART 请求直到 "
"SETTLED；它不停止外层 UART／RX 所有者。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:65
msgid "Keep CANopen staging separate from product commands"
msgstr "区分 CANopen 暂存数据与产品命令"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:67
msgid ""
"Explicit `nexus_add_canopen()` creates `Nexus::CANopen` from the locked real"
" CANopenNode protocol objects. One task owns the existing started CAN port, "
"bounded RX/TX slots, private workspace and product OD values. Node ID, peer,"
" filters, heartbeat periods and maximum step gap are explicit. The profile "
"has one expedited 1/2/4-byte SDO server and one asynchronous PDO per "
"direction, each mapping 1..8 bytes; it does not select CiA402, CAN FD or "
"authentication."
msgstr ""
"显式调用 `nexus_add_canopen()`，从锁定的真实 CANopenNode 协议对象创建 `Nexus::CANopen`。一个 "
"task 拥有已启动的既有 CAN 端口、有界 RX／TX slot、私有工作区和产品 OD 值。节点 ID、对端、过滤器、心跳周期及最大 step "
"间隔均明确给定。该配置包含一个 1/2/4-byte 快速 SDO server，每方向一个异步 PDO，各映射 1..8 bytes；不选择 "
"CiA402、CAN FD 或认证能力。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:74
msgid ""
"RX loss, mailbox overrun, wrong PDO length, bus-off, time discontinuity and "
"TX exhaustion close admission. Queued frames retain their first finite "
"deadline. Reset is reported and closes admission before SDO/PDO staging "
"writes; no MCU reset is executed. Product validation still checks complete "
"command units, sequence, epoch and validity before use. NMT Operational is "
"not actuator enable. Stop discards unsent copies and drains the original "
"accepted CAN request, including service after cancel failure. Reclaim "
"workspace and OD only after successful stop and joined callers; the outer "
"CAN owner remains separate."
msgstr ""
"RX 丢失、邮箱溢出、PDO 长度错误、bus-off、时间不连续和 TX 耗尽均关闭准入。排队帧保留首次有限 deadline。重置请求先被报告，并在"
" SDO／PDO 写入暂存区前关闭准入，不执行 MCU reset。产品使用数据前仍须验证完整命令的单位、序号、epoch 和有效期。NMT "
"Operational 不代表执行器使能。stop 丢弃尚未发送的副本，并排空原已接受 CAN 请求，取消失败后仍继续 service。只有 stop "
"成功且调用者已会合后，才可回收工作区和 OD；外层 CAN 所有者独立保留。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:83
msgid "Render only in the selected GUI executor"
msgstr "只在选定 GUI 执行者中渲染"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:85
msgid ""
"Explicit `nexus_add_lvgl()` creates `Nexus::LVGL`. One task owns GUI calls, "
"callbacks and the caller workspace, including the fixed 32 KiB TLSF pool; "
"there is no libc heap or worker. Only one live GUI owner is permitted. "
"Product UI implementation alone links `Nexus::LVGLProfile` to use selected "
"official label/button APIs; ordinary business code keeps Nexus/application "
"types."
msgstr ""
"显式调用 `nexus_add_lvgl()` 创建 `Nexus::LVGL`。一个 task 拥有 GUI 调用、回调和调用者工作区，其中含固定 "
"32 KiB TLSF 池；不使用 libc 堆或工作线程。同时只允许一个活动 GUI 所有者。仅产品 UI 实现链接 "
"`Nexus::LVGLProfile` 以使用选定的官方 label／button API；普通业务代码保持 Nexus／应用类型。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:91
msgid ""
"The caller supplies an aligned RGB565 tile, explicit elapsed milliseconds "
"and a finite service deadline. Settled flush callbacks release every tile "
"reference before returning, including errors. Deadline checks cannot preempt"
" rendering or widget callbacks. Errors close GUI progress but do not erase "
"the panel's recovery duties. Join all widget/event users before stop; "
"successful stop invalidates widget pointers and releases arena/tile "
"references. Display, touch and bus shutdown remain external. See the "
"[selected GUI contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/protocols/lvgl/README.md) for pool-"
"exhaustion fail-stop and complete scope."
msgstr ""
"调用者提供对齐的 RGB565 tile、显式经过的毫秒数和有限 service deadline。已结清的 flush 回调必须在返回前释放每一份 "
"tile 引用，错误返回也如此。deadline 检查不能抢占渲染或 widget 回调。错误关闭 GUI 进度，不撤销面板的恢复责任。stop "
"前会合所有 widget／event 使用者；stop 成功后 widget 指针失效，并释放 arena／tile "
"引用。显示、触摸和总线的停止仍由外部负责。[选定 GUI 合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/protocols/lvgl/README.md)说明池耗尽时的故障停驻及完整范围。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:100
msgid "Separate local transfer from product update policy"
msgstr "区分本地传输与产品更新策略"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:102
msgid ""
"XMODEM validates sequence, complement and CRC before each bounded 128-byte "
"write callback. A repeated previous block is acknowledged without writing it"
" again. The caller copies emitted control bytes into its own TX state, "
"supplies same-domain time to feed/poll, and enforces the finite session and "
"packet budgets. BUSY with a pending control byte does not consume new input."
msgstr ""
"XMODEM 在每次有界 128-byte write callback 前验证序号、反码和 CRC。重复的上一 block 仅 "
"ACK，不再次写入。调用者将输出 control byte 复制到自己的 TX 状态，为 feed／poll 提供同域时间，并执行有限 "
"session／packet 预算。有 pending control byte 时，BUSY 不消费新输入。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:108
msgid ""
"Every callback receives 128 bytes including sender padding. Product length, "
"manifest, authorization, staging and signature/version checks determine "
"usable content and whether an update may proceed. Accepted blocks are not "
"rolled back by cancellation or failure. This profile has no checksum "
"fallback, 1 KiB blocks, YMODEM filename handling, Flash partition selection "
"or reboot policy."
msgstr ""
"每次 callback 收到含发送方 padding 的 128 字节。产品 length、manifest、授权、staging "
"和签名／版本检查确定有效内容及是否允许更新。取消或失败不回滚已接纳 block。此 profile 无 checksum fallback、1 KiB "
"block、YMODEM 文件名、Flash partition 选择或 reboot 策略。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:114
msgid "Keep UTC quality separate from monotonic deadlines"
msgstr "区分 UTC 质量与单调 deadline"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:116
msgid ""
"WallClock does not modify Core time or scheduler deadlines. It combines an "
"explicit UTC sample with its monotonic observation, validity interval and "
"stated oscillator-drift bound. Ordinary SNTP results remain MEASURED; the "
"product must review a source before asserting TRUSTED. A parse result cannot"
" bypass TLS's trusted-time requirement."
msgstr ""
"WallClock 不修改 Core 时间或 scheduler deadline。它将显式 UTC 样本与其单调观测、有效期及声明的 "
"oscillator drift 上界组合。普通 SNTP 结果保持 MEASURED，产品须审查来源后才能声明 TRUSTED。解析结果不能绕过 "
"TLS 的可信时间要求。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:122
msgid ""
"The product validates the response source IP/port, original unpredictable "
"request token and unique outstanding request, and explicitly selects NTP era"
" 0 or 1. Uncertainty includes local RTT and server delay/dispersion, without"
" proving network symmetry, source honesty or physical timestamp accuracy. "
"Invalid, expired or discontinuous time must not become a fabricated usable "
"UTC value."
msgstr ""
"产品验证 response source IP／port、原始不可预测 request token 及唯一 outstanding "
"request，并显式选择 NTP era 0 或 1。不确定度包含本地往返时延（RTT）和 server "
"delay／dispersion，不证明网络对称、来源诚实或物理 timestamp 准确。无效、到期或不连续时间不得变成伪造的可用 UTC 值。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:128
msgid ""
"Join callbacks and release borrowed views before resetting or reclaiming "
"session storage, then close the lower transport under its own contract. "
"Software protocol results do not establish physical serial/network timing or"
" device qualification; hardware HIL remains `not_executed`."
msgstr ""
"重置或回收会话存储前，先会合回调并释放借用视图，再按下层传输自己的合同关闭它。软件协议结果不建立物理串口／网络时序或器件资格；硬件 HIL 保持 "
"`not_executed`。"

