msgstr ""
"不执行 I/O、分配或命令重放。改变／释放 descriptor 前，调用者须会合此前回调。HEADER／PROMPT 视图在回调返回时失效；既有 "
"expect_binary 回调例外仍适用。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:155
msgid "[inout] Same serialized task owner, no pending command/data."
msgstr "[inout] 同一串行 task 所有者，无待处理 command／data。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:155
msgid "[in] Disjoint immutable tokens, or NULL to restore line mode."
msgstr "[in] 不重叠的不可变 token；NULL 表示恢复按行模式。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:155
msgid ""
"SUCCESS, INVALID, BUSY for an active/partial parser, or STATE after "
"desynchronization; rejection keeps the original selection."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID；parser 活跃或保留部分输入时为 BUSY，失步后为 STATE；拒绝保持原选择。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:155
msgid "Copy one command and append CRLF without starting transport."
msgstr "复制一条命令并追加 CRLF，不启动 transport。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:155
msgid ""
"Only one command is active. Standard OK/ERROR/+CME ERROR/ +CMS ERROR "
"terminate it. Module-specific replies use events."
msgstr ""
"同一时刻只允许一条 active command。标准 OK／ERROR／+CME ERROR／+CMS ERROR 结束命令。模块特定 reply 经"
" event 交付。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:155
msgid "[inout] Initialized serialized healthy state."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化、串行且 healthy 的状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:155
msgid "[in] Nonempty text, no NUL/CR/LF, copied before return."
msgstr "[in] 非空文本，不含 NUL／CR／LF，返回前复制。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:155
msgid "[in] Text byte count, excludes terminator."
msgstr "[in] 文本字节数，不含终止符。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:155
msgid "[in] Finite absolute deadline in the stream clock domain."
msgstr "[in] stream clock 域内的有限绝对 deadline。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:155
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, BUSY, EXHAUSTED, TIMEOUT or STATE."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、BUSY、EXHAUSTED、TIMEOUT 或 STATE。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:155
msgid "Advance immediate copying stream calls with explicit budget."
msgstr "以显式预算推进即时复制的 stream 调用。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:155
msgid ""
"No waits/worker. Callbacks are bounded, cannot reenter any client operation "
"except expect_binary. Timeout/overflow or I/O loss latches "
"desynchronization; recover explicitly after the product has drained/reset "
"the module to a known boundary."
msgstr ""
"无等待／worker。callback 必须有界，除 expect_binary 外不得重入任何 client 操作。timeout／overflow "
"或 I/O 丢失锁存失同步；产品将模块排空／reset 到已知边界后再显式 recover。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:155
msgid "[inout] Initialized state and all retained storage still live."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化状态及全部保留存储仍存活。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:155
msgid "[in] Finite service deadline, bounded with command time."
msgstr "[in] 有限 service deadline，与 command 时间共同约束。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:155
msgid "[in] Nonzero maximum individual read/write calls."
msgstr "[in] 独立 read／write 调用次数的非零上限。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:155
msgid "SUCCESS for progress, BUSY for no progress, or failure."
msgstr "推进时 SUCCESS，无进展时 BUSY，或失败。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:155
msgid "Select the next exact bytes as binary, including CR/LF/NUL."
msgstr "将后续精确字节选择为 binary，包含 CR／LF／NUL。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:155
msgid ""
"Payload is reported in callback-scoped chunks; the caller validates its "
"module's length before invoking this method."
msgstr "payload 以 callback 存活期内的 chunk 报告；调用者在调用本方法前验证模块给出的长度。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:155
msgid "[inout] Serialized initialized parser, optionally in event."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化串行 parser，也可在 event 内。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:155
msgid "[in] Positive exact module-announced binary length."
msgstr "[in] 模块宣布的精确正数 binary 长度。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:155
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, BUSY or STATE; no transport access."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、BUSY 或 STATE；不访问 transport。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:155
msgid "Reset software framing after external synchronization."
msgstr "外部同步后 reset 软件分帧状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:155
msgid "Abandons a timed-out command, never silently replays it."
msgstr "放弃已超时 command，从不静默 replay。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:155
msgid ""
"[inout] All event/stream calls have returned; healthy module boundary and "
"transport drain are independently established."
msgstr "[inout] 所有 event／stream 调用已返回；healthy 模块边界与 transport 排空已独立建立。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:155
msgid "SUCCESS, BUSY or INVALID; does not reset or probe hardware."
msgstr "SUCCESS、BUSY 或 INVALID；不 reset 或 probe 硬件。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:155
msgid "Optional immutable framing tokens, selected only at a quiet boundary."
msgstr "只在静默边界选择的可选不可变分帧 token。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:155
msgid ""
"binary_prefix is NULL to disable header recognition; otherwise it is "
"nonempty, printable and shorter than line capacity. A matching line prefix "
"followed by binary_delimiter emits HEADER without the delimiter. The "
"callback validates the full header and calls expect_binary before returning;"
" otherwise framing fails before any payload is interpreted. prompt is zero "
"to disable or one printable byte recognized at empty line position without "
"CRLF. No module command or length grammar lives in the generic parser. "
"Descriptor and strings remain immutable/live through every parser use, "
"including recovery."
msgstr ""
"binary_prefix 为 NULL 时禁用 header 识别；否则须非空、可打印且短于 line 容量。匹配的 line prefix 后出现 "
"binary_delimiter 时，发出不含 delimiter 的 HEADER。回调验证完整 header，并在返回前调用 "
"expect_binary；否则在解释任何 payload 前分帧即失败。prompt 为零表示禁用，否则是在空行位置无须 CRLF "
"即可识别的单个可打印字节。通用 parser 不包含模块命令或长度语法。descriptor 及字符串在所有 parser "
"使用期间保持不可变且存活，包括恢复期间。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:155
msgid "Explicit caller-owned state; fields private after initialization."
msgstr "显式调用者状态；初始化后字段为私有。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:155
msgid "Stable assembly ports; no worker, ISR callbacks or UART ownership."
msgstr "稳定装配端口；无 worker、ISR callback 或 UART owner 责任。"

